<title>INDIA: Indian July CPI up 8.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Indian July CPI up 8.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's annual rate of inflation as measured by the consumer price index (CPI) was 8.3 percent in July, the government said.</p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES	   Jul 96	Jul 95</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	+8.3	 +11.4</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1982)     339	   313</p>
<p>Note - Figures for July 1996 are preliminary.</p>
</text>
